  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "- DownloadFulbright Specialist Host Institution Application Instructions (PDF, 337 KB)vertical\\_align\\_bottom\n\n- DownloadFulbright Specialist - Host Institution Project Proposal Form (DOCX, 168 KB)vertical\\_align\\_bottom\n\nThe Fulbright Specialist Program allows you to invite an expert from the U.S. for a period of 2 to 6 weeks to your group to work with you to deliver workshops or seminars, develop academic curricula or training, lecture or conduct assessments, and build up long term academic relationships and collaboration\n\nYour proposed program should start at the latest in fall 2024.\n\nHow to find a specialist:\n\nFor more information see the instructions below or the Specialist Program website .\n\nTo apply: fill in the form below and send it back to .\n\nNormally the program is based on cost-share. For proposals submitted by 30 September 2024 to the US Embassy in Bern, all costs will be covered by the Fulbright program.\n\nMs Gaby Bloem Senior Public Affairs Specialist, United States Embassy Bern E-mail:"
    }
